# Claude Timeline
# The shared external drive (models, media, ROMs, website rips): only its README is part of the project.
Local Storage/*
!Local Storage/README.txt
# The portable Python runtimes (Windows, and Mac for Apple silicon) are installed, not committed.
Python/
Python-mac/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Personal: the user's identity and the launcher's per-machine settings
Profile/*
ClaudeLauncher/settings.json
# Claude7 seed: the Windows 7 art and sound library and the old simulator's runtime data stay local
Claude7/seed/Windows 7 Parts/
Claude7/seed/win7_2011/Storage/
# Game saves and high scores, shared by every era (personal)
ClaudeGames/Saves/
# Kithylin AI keeps its own art, models and chats in its folder (personal, and large)
ClaudeApps/kithylinai/Art/
ClaudeApps/kithylinai/Models/
ClaudeApps/kithylinai/Data/
# Files macOS leaves on the drive
._*
.DS_Store
.Spotlight-V100/
.fseventsd/
.Trashes/
# The Claude Entertainment System .scr: its build Python, build folder and the built screen saver (sprites inside)
ClaudeApps/cesscr/.venv-build/
ClaudeApps/cesscr/build/
ClaudeApps/cesscr/dist/
# The tests: the last run's report
Tests/last run.txt
